// Sub-agents: diagnostics, sources, metadata.

%locale: 
%namespace: subagent

diagnostic.fileaccesserror: File Access Error
diagnostic.fileaccesserror.hint: Unable to read the sub-agent file. Check file permissions.
diagnostic.generalparsingerror: Parse Error
diagnostic.generalparsingerror.hint: An unexpected error occurred while parsing the sub-agent file.
diagnostic.missingdescription: Missing Description
diagnostic.missingdescription.hint: The sub-agent has no description. Add a description in YAML frontmatter or as the first paragraph.
diagnostic.missingfile: File Missing
diagnostic.missingfile.hint: The sub-agent file could not be found at the expected location.
diagnostic.missingname: Missing Name
diagnostic.missingname.hint: The sub-agent has no name defined in YAML frontmatter, header, or file name.
diagnostic.missingyaml: Missing YAML
diagnostic.missingyaml.hint: The sub-agent file does not have a YAML frontmatter block (--- ... ---).
diagnostic.missingyamldescription: Missing YAML Description
diagnostic.missingyamldescription.hint: The 'description' field is missing from the YAML frontmatter. A fallback was used.
diagnostic.missingyamlname: Missing YAML Name
diagnostic.missingyamlname.hint: The 'name' field is missing from the YAML frontmatter. A fallback name was used.
diagnostic.namefilemismatch: Name/File Mismatch
diagnostic.namefilemismatch.hint: The sub-agent name does not match the name of the file containing it.
diagnostic.nameformaterror: Invalid Name Format
diagnostic.nameformaterror.hint: The sub-agent name contains invalid characters. Sub-agent names must use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.
diagnostic.yamldecodingerror: YAML Decode Error
diagnostic.yamldecodingerror.hint: Failed to deserialize the YAML frontmatter into the expected structure.
diagnostic.yamlparsingerror: YAML Syntax Error
diagnostic.yamlparsingerror.hint: The YAML frontmatter contains invalid syntax.
metadata.author: Author
metadata.compatibility: Compatibility
metadata.license: License
metadata.version: Version
source.custom: Custom
source.template: Template
source.unknown: Unknown
source.userprofile: User Profile
source.workingdirectory: Working Directory
sub_agents_enabled_by_default: Enable unchanged sub-agents by default
sub_agents_enabled_by_default.hint: When checked, sub-agents without an explicit per-agent override are enabled by default. Uncheck to disable all unchanged sub-agents.
